  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Live Saving Support to patients with diabetes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main goal: to prevent premature death persons with diabetes. Give people with diabetes diagnosis the opportunity to keep the disease under complete control, as well as to make life easier for parents (and mothers of kids with diabetes) to take disease under control.Activities: to purchase continuous control systems, find opportunities to provide people with diabetes with everything that is needed: consumables, devices and in basic sensors (blood glucose monitoring system).</narrative>
  </description>
